I am writing with some news on a personal note, which nonetheless has a bearing on the renewal. I have accepted a role elsewhere, and my last day at Veritas will be this Friday, the eleventh. My successor starts tomorrow and will be in touch with you directly this week; I have briefed them fully on the timetable Walter set out, on the usage figures we exchanged in August and on the tier question, so nothing should be lost in the handover.

